(6: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Summary%0A%0AFixes%20%231.%0A%0AThis%20PR%20replaces%20the%20template%20crate%20with%20a%20Rust%20%60meta-language%60%20core%3A%20a%20self-describing%20links-network%20representation%20for%20lossless%20parsing%2C%20verification%2C%20projection%2C%20transformation%2C%20reconstruction%2C%20and%20versioned%20snapshots.%0A%0AIt%20also%20addresses%20the%20latest%20PR%20feedback%20by%20making%20competitor%20and%20language%20coverage%20executable%20in%20this%20PR%20and%20by%20keeping%20tests%20out%20of%20%60src%2F%60.%20Every%20tracked%20competitor%2Fecosystem%20target%20now%20has%20a%20%60PARITY_FIXTURES%60%20entry%2C%20every%20advertised%20target%20capability%20must%20be%20exercised%20by%20at%20least%20one%20fixture%20for%20that%20target%2C%20every%20requested%20Markdown%2FHTML%2Fprogramming%2Fnatural-language%20target%20has%20a%20%60LANGUAGE_FIXTURES%60%20parse%2Freconstruction%20fixture%2C%20snapshot%2Fversioning%20is%20tested%20as%20part%20of%20persistent%20syntax%20parity%2C%20and%20CI%20rejects%20Rust%20test%20markers%20under%20%60src%2F%60.%0A%0A%23%23%20Implementation%0A%0A-%20Renames%20the%20crate%20and%20binary%20to%20%60meta-language%60%20%2F%20%60meta_language%60.%0A-%20Adds%20%60LinkNetwork%60%2C%20%60Link%60%2C%20%60LinkId%60%2C%20source%20spans%2C%20parse%20flags%2C%20metadata%2C%20verification%20reports%2C%20and%20configuration%20for%20trivia%20attachment%20and%20mixed-language%20region%20detection.%0A-%20Models%20points%20as%20self-referential%20links%2C%20relation%20links%20as%20ordinary%20links%2C%20field%20labels%20as%20explicit%20relation%20links%2C%20object%20identity%20as%20shared%20links%2C%20and%20concept%20syntax%20mappings%20for%20target-language%20reconstruction.%0A-%20Adds%20%60LinkNetwork%3A%3Aparse%60%20as%20the%20default%20lossless%20parse%20entry%20point%20and%20%60reconstruct_text%28%29%60%20for%20exact%20reconstruction%20from%20non-missing%20token%20links.%0A-%20Adds%20recovery%20markers%20for%20unmatched%20parentheses%20while%20preserving%20original%20text.%0A-%20Adds%20mixed-region%20detection%20for%20Markdown%20fenced%20code%20and%20HTML%20regions%2C%20plus%20HTML%20script%2Fstyle%2Fstyle-attribute%20regions%20and%20content-driven%20fenced-code%20detection.%0A-%20Adds%20%60NetworkProjection%60%2C%20%60LinkQuery%60%2C%20%60SubstitutionRule%60%2C%20%60TruthValue%60%2C%20and%20concept%20reconstruction%20APIs.%0A-%20Adds%20immutable%20%60NetworkSnapshot%60%20and%20editable%20%60MutableNetworkSnapshot%60%20APIs%20with%20provenance%20and%20forward%20version%20commits.%0A-%20Adds%20self-description%20roots%20for%20%60link%60%2C%20%60reference%60%2C%20%60relation%20link%60%2C%20%60language%60%2C%20%60grammar%60%2C%20%60type%60%2C%20%60concept%60%2C%20%60point%60%2C%20%60field%60%2C%20%60trivia%60%2C%20%60region%60%2C%20and%20%60object%60.%0A-%20Adds%20%60PARITY_TARGETS%60%2C%20%60PARITY_FIXTURES%60%2C%20%60LANGUAGE_FIXTURES%60%2C%20language%20target%20registries%2C%20grammar%20embedding%20targets%2C%20and%20tests%20for%20all%20of%20them.%0A-%20Moves%20Rust%20tests%20into%20the%20%60tests%2F%60%20tree%20and%20adds%20%60scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%2C%20workflow%20coverage%2C%20pre-commit%20coverage%2C%20and%20docs%20so%20%60%23%5Btest%5D%60%2C%20%60%23%5Bcfg%28test%29%5D%60%2C%20and%20test%20module%20markers%20under%20%60src%2F%60%20fail%20CI.%0A-%20Updates%20README%2C%20parity%20implementation%20docs%2C%20examples%2C%20and%20changelog%20fragments.%0A%0A%23%23%20Reproduction%20%2F%20Tests%0A%0AThe%20reproducing%20gap%20was%20that%20competitor%20coverage%20was%20previously%20roadmap-only%2C%20source-tree%20tests%20were%20not%20explicitly%20forbidden%2C%20and%20snapshot%2Fversioning%20was%20named%20by%20the%20roadmap%20without%20an%20executable%20API.%20The%20unit%20tests%20now%20fail%20unless%20every%20%60PARITY_TARGETS%60%20entry%20has%20executable%20fixtures%20covering%20every%20advertised%20capability%2C%20every%20requested%20language%20target%20has%20a%20lossless%20fixture%2C%20core%20behavior%20works%20for%20reconstruction%2C%20recovery%20diagnostics%2C%20mixed%20regions%2C%20queries%2C%20substitutions%2C%20concept%20reconstruction%2C%20object%20identity%2C%20snapshots%2Fversion%20commits%2C%20and%20many-valued%20truth%20values%2C%20and%20the%20workflow%20keeps%20the%20no-%60src%60-tests%20guard%20wired%20into%20CI.%0A%0ALocal%20verification%20passed%3A%0A%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--all%20--%20--check%60%0A-%20%60RUSTFLAGS%3D-Dwarnings%20cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-changelog-fragment.rs%60%0A-%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%0A%0A%23%23%20Notes%0A%0AThis%20is%20not%20a%20UI%20change%2C%20so%20screenshots%20are%20not%20included.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
